==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Brollow]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*2 [[Cadaver Bear]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**3 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**3 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**3 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]] to snipe the Brollows and gain [[Money Up]]. Use the Holy Blast and meatshield thoroughly while using some [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] [[:Category:Nuker-class Cats|nuker]] to kill the two Cadaver Bears.

When the battle starts, spam [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] with one [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], or [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]]. Get as close as you can to the base and force the first Cadaver Bear to burrow. Stop spamming once its burrow activates as you don't want to hit the base and spawn the Brollows that are hiding in there. Kill the first Cadaver Bear with [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dragons]] and use Bullet Train to snipe the Brollows. When the second Cadaver Bear comes, let it burrow and use the holy blast to knock it out of the ground. Continue to stack Dragons and it should be an easy win!

